{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"一、十年。春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"二、夏，晉欒施來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"三、秋七月，季孫隱如、叔弓、仲孫貜帥師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"四、戊子，晉侯彪卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"五、九月，叔孫舍如晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"六、葬晉平公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_190_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_190","textTraditional":"七、十有二月甲子，宋公戍卒。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}